   "text": "{\n\"meetingId\": \"834\",\n\"tickets\": [\n{\n\"templateId\": \"eeaa9b5d-78e4-55ba-98d9-0f6ae221111e\",\n\"title\": \"Follow up on account security concern\",\n\"text\": \"Security concern type: unauthorized access\\nAffected account or platform: Velvet Acorn Custody\\nDate client reported concern: 2025-11-06\\nClient's preferred contact method: secure portal messages or phone calls\\nImmediate action requested: custodian escalation, credential reset coordination, evidence documentation, phone update\\nCustodian or platform contact: Velvet Acorn Custody\\nEvidence to review: Paige’s forwarded login alert for a session she did not recognize and her statement that she could not verify whether recent account activity was legitimate\\nResolution status: open\\nNext client update: by 2025-11-07\\nInternal notes: \\nPaige Lanternmoss reported an unrecognized login alert on her Velvet Acorn Custody account and could not verify recent activity. The follow-up includes custodian escalation, credential reset coordination, evidence documentation, and a phone update to Paige by 2025-11-07.\",\n\"priority\": \"high\",\n\"dueDate\": \"2025-11-07\",\n\"assigneeId\": null,\n\"subTasks\": [],\n\"evidence\": \"They agreed on follow-up by 2025-11-07 covering custodian escalation, evidence documentation, credential reset coordination, and a phone update to Paige.\"\n},\n{\n\"templateId\": \"d59658c9-3bcc-573c-a34e-479818bc4c60\",\n\"title\": \"Follow up on missing signature\",\n\"text\": \"Contact Darin Lanternmoss through the approved communication channel to explain which document still needs signature, where to sign, and how to return it securely. Confirm receipt of the completed signature page and update the document status log. The portal upload contains Paige Lanternmoss's signed pages but not Darin Lanternmoss's signature page. Contact Darin through the approved channel, explain the required signature location, and confirm secure return of the signed page by 2025-11-10.\",\n\"priority\": \"medium\",\n\"dueDate\": \"2025-11-10\",\n\"assigneeId\": \"ddfe45a4-1a81-5a26-8db5-0d7287fbbec9\",\n\"subTasks\": [],\n\"evidence\": \"For the household authorization package, the portal upload contains Paige’s signed pages but not Darin’s signature page. They agreed on follow-up by 2025-11-10 to contact Darin through the approved channel, explain the required signature location, and confirm secure return of the signed page.\"\n},\n{\n\"templateId\": \"340a01fd-6530-54e3-8336-c6224508592f\",\n\"title\": \"Track custodian transfer status\",\n\"text\": \"Check the pending transfer with the receiving custodian, note the latest status, and alert the advisor if assets, cost basis, or residual cash have not arrived as expected. Check the Velvet Acorn Custody transfer tracker for the taxable account move from Teacup Comet Brokerage. The cost basis file and a small residual cash sweep do not match the sending statement Paige Lanternmoss uploaded. Document whether remaining assets or basis details are still pending by 2025-11-12.\",\n\"priority\": \"medium\",\n\"dueDate\": \"2025-11-12\",\n\"assigneeId\": null,\n\"subTasks\": [],\n\"evidence\": \"For the taxable account move, the Velvet Acorn Custody transfer tracker shows securities received from Teacup Comet Brokerage, but the cost basis file and a small residual cash sweep do not match the sending statement Paige uploaded. They agreed on follow-up by 2025-11-12 to check the receiving custodian’s latest status and document whether remaining assets or basis details are still pending.\"\n},\n{\n\"templateId\": \"96edd7b2-1df4-595b-96aa-9e7c04b9813d\",\n\"title\": \"Complete beneficiary update workflow\",\n\"text\": \"Use this workflow when a client needs to add, remove, or revise beneficiary designations. Confirm the requested change, gather the required custodian forms or online instructions, submit the update, and verify the custodian's final confirmation before closing the loop with the client. Paige Lanternmoss requested changes to IRA beneficiary records, including revised primary and contingent percentages for Darin Lanternmoss, Liora Lanternmoss, and the Willow Pudding Family Trust. Confirm the requested designations, identify the correct Velvet Acorn Custody process, and flag any trust wording that may require estate attorney review by 2025-11-14.\",\n\"priority\": \"medium\",\n\"dueDate\": \"2025-11-14\",\n\"assigneeId\": null,\n\"subTasks\": [\n{\n\"title\": \"Confirm beneficiary instructions\",\n\"text\": \"Review the client's requested beneficiary changes, including primary and contingent beneficiaries, percentages, relationship details, and any per stirpes or trust-related language. Flag anything that requires attorney or estate planning review. For Paige Lanternmoss's IRA beneficiary updates for Darin Lanternmoss, Liora Lanternmoss, and Willow Pudding Family Trust.\",\n\"priority\": \"medium\",\n\"assigneeId\": \"08744d31-7555-51ee-a1eb-a482b9defeeb\"\n,\n\"dueDate\": \"2025-11-211-211-211-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-2111-21